                      "fill": "$--color-text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Born and raised in Stockholm, Anna has spent over a decade sharing her passion for the city's rich history. A certified heritage guide with expertise in Royal Palace history and medieval Stockholm, she brings the past to life with warmth and authority.",
