                      "name": "bio2",
                      "fill": "$--color-text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "With a degree in Architecture and a lifelong fascination with Stockholm's evolving skyline, Erik reveals the hidden details in every façade. From Art Nouveau gems on Strandvägen to modernist masterpieces on Södermalm.",
