                      "name": "bio4",
                      "fill": "$--color-text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "With a PhD in Scandinavian History and 15 years as a museum curator, Lars brings unmatched scholarly depth to every tour. His expertise in Royal Palace history and Riddarholmen makes him a living encyclopedia of Stockholm's past.",
