                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Sofia's culinary tours are a favorite for all senses. With a diploma in Culinary Arts, she blends history with gastronomy — from traditional Swedish fika spots to hidden local gems across Södermalm.",
